WEBVTT

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.660
Ryo-niichan.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:02.190
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:08.220
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.600
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:16.000
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.280
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.240
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:27.480
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.650
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.290
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:37.230
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:42.100
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:47.940
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:53.840
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:01:53.840 --> 00:02:05.290
kasaneta inochi ga
yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:09.090
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:14.900
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:22.430
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:33.240
The girl called this "the scab?"

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.950
Yes.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:41.080
It looks like an ordinary feather, but
scientifically, it remains unidentified.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.820
A whale's feather...

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:47.290
We've had one in our family for a long
time and my parents called it that.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:51.890
They wrote a picture book based on it

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:56.030
and had my sister keep it as a protective charm.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:04.010
The incidents occurring at Toyama Bay
and the shorelines of Ayanagi city...

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:08.710
That feather was found at all
the sites where they happened.

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.150
You said the girl's name was Ayane?

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:20.090
Hiiragi gave me this to help confirm if the
man named Kujo is who I believe he is.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.370
Ayane-chan...

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.440
That's her!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.060
She's appeared in front of us a lot.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.170
Komatsubara Ayane...

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:36.910
The only daughter of Komatsubara Keisuke,
now Kujo Mareya, leader of the Marebito,

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:41.750
and once one of the greatest
authorities in the medical field.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:46.590
She was used as a Complex
Persona test subject by her father.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:47.610
Are you serious?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.290
His own daughter?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.290
So who we saw was?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.730
I can't really say.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:59.890
We just know she went missing while
en route to a project sponsor gathering.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.800
I was one of them, too.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.940
Komatsubara...

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:15.020
Personas have the frightening power to
enslave and drive certain people to insanity.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:20.820
There are countless people who try to take
advantage of the scientific efforts behind it.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:29.750
Kanzato, Inui, and I have been working to
end this conspiracy and its tragic spiral.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:40.300
The reason behind dragging you all in, even though
you could've been left alone, is this mission.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.810
Um... Sanada-san...

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.950
People are disappearing and then
reappear near the sea and city.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:51.990
Are those related to this?

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.150
Why would you ask?

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:58.060
Because both are mysterious...
or beyond imagination. I mean...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.150
So the whole body and mind
swapping thing is also?

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.030
Could be.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:12.230
We think the artificial Persona research is
related to the incidents of ten years ago, as well.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.170
The Whale is ill.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.940
However, coming to such a
conclusion now is too rash.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:26.510
We must first eliminate the Marebito's
Complex Personas as soon as possible

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:30.880
and dismantle their organization.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.020
Shin... Kayano... Sakakiba...

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:40.670
They'll make their move soon. Make sure to practice
at least three of the battle patterns we taught you.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.330
There won't be too many enemies to go against.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.210
And Shin, I'd like to get permission
to investigate your house.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:47.830
What? ...Why?

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.210
I'd like to...

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.070
Get to know your brothers, your family, a little bit.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.310
Counselor.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:02.180
What are your thoughts on this whole deal?

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.920
I would be lying if I said I'm completely sure of it.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:11.420
But I've come to realize it's impossible
to negotiate with them fairly.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.830
Of course... That's become rather self-evident.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:18.310
If we miss this opportunity,
things will grow hopeless.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:23.300
Even if we suppress the Marebito,
the situation is already...

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:24.710
Nonetheless...

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.550
I don't know much about that.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:32.150
Regardless, I'll do what I can to
prepare for whatever will happen.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.350
I appreciate it.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:38.730
This is going to burden our Vice
Chief... the temporary chief, and...

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:44.030
If everything goes as planned, the
person in most danger will be...

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:53.570
Let's hope everything falls into place and the
authorities don't pick up on it until the end.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.860
I've got a question for you.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.500
I'm sorry... I wasn't being carried away or anything.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.660
Not that.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:25.730
How did you feel when it happened?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.200
What do you mean?

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.410
When your Persona was cut off by Kanzato Shin.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.540
Like... I was freed...

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.120
Where are Sotaro and Shiiba?

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.950
Can you ask Kanzato Shin?

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.760
With his Persona's sword...

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.060
You, Sotaro, Shiiba, and...

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.260
Can't.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:56.260
We will never be forgiven.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.230
We... have to forge ahead.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.310
Saki!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.080
Kujo-san said

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:10.590
he will be needed at the very end.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.920
He's not going to wake up anytime soon.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.150
Who knows if he ever will?

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:19.190
I... believe in Kujo-san.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:23.460
The significance of his mission...

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.620
I believe in it.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.770
Toma gave his life for it.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.120
Oniichan!

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:55.520
What's going on? You sent a strange text.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.970
Did I scare you?

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.160
Of course. I was in the middle of class.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.370
What did you tell your teacher?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:08.440
Well... I said I've got the chills and a headache...

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.900
And I let out some coughs...

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.110
I bet it was obvious you were faking.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.620
So, what is it? What's this something
you can only talk to me about right now?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:20.720
Let's go.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.210
G-go? Go where?

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.790
It's just once in a while, right?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.820
H-hey... Jun...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.160
Hey! You've been-

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:10.970
Yuki!

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.580
Are you... by yourself?

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.040
Where's Jun?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.280
He's gone...

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.520
I wonder where he is?

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:26.550
Hey...

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:29.950
Just kidding.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.790
We wanted to be alone.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.360
Both me and Jun.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.830
We've never thought that way before.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.970
Jun might be with Ryo-oniichan by now...

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:46.510
What?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.800
I have a feeling.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.110
Don't worry. He'll be back.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.970
We were just here.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.500
It's fine. I just wanna walk around with you.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.340
You're weird.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.190
Um... Kanzato-kun...

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.290
How are you feeling?

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:51.970
Um... I heard wrapping your neck with green
onion is good for when you have a cold.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.970
I'll just leave them here...

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:55.470
And...

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.560
You know, that Komatsubara guy...

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.930
He saved Jun and me, right?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.390
Revealing patient information is strictly
forbidden -Komatsubara Keisuke

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.370
Is that... right?

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.640
What's wrong?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.080
I bet it was hard for aniki and you two.

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.450
Only I was unaware.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.460
That's not true.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.050
You've always been...

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:46.990
What is it?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.990
Oniichan... That guy...

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.990
He's been there since noon.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:55.270
Isn't there another clock tower just like that one?

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.500
Yeah...

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:05.410
The only reason why Jun
and I were able to live on...

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.640
was because we became as one very quickly.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:18.180
And you naturally accepted
my existence inside of Jun.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:25.320
You treated us as you would normally.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.190
Jun feels the same way.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.900
Oniichan...

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.410
I love you.

00:13:57.970 --> 00:13:58.730
Yuki...

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:21.390
Ayane-chan! Put us back to how we were!

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:25.980
Where's Jun? We can't use
our Persona without him.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.130
With our Persona...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.890
we can treat others' Personas.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.730
Ayane-chan!?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.160
Hello?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.130
Megumi-san?

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:44.540
Oh, I can come, too?

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:47.410
Okay, I'll be there.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.540
...Just a little longer.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.120
Thank you very much!

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:09.960
Yamasaki?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.480
Yeah, the Counselor is searching the Chief's room.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.740
I thought that would've been better, but...

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:22.510
I regretted it immediately...
There's so much weird stuff.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:26.950
C-crap, something broke.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:33.030
Oops, sorry. It's just, watching
you and the Counselor is...

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.260
What is it?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.220
...You wanted the Chief to depend
on you like this too, right?

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:42.800
I'm sure the Chief wanted to, if he could.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:47.900
That's why he left the data regarding
Personas just to you and the Vice Chief.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.510
It's not a big deal like that.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.770
I wonder where the Chief is?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.550
That aside, make sure they don't see you.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:00.080
Oh, yes, sir...

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.820
I know it's too late to mention this,
but... This is way too risky...

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.490
Isn't there another way?

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.500
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.590
It's no problem.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:18.500
There's literally nothing left in his room.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:23.340
Did you notice him performing any major
cleaning or organizing before he disappeared?

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.310
Not especially...

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.210
So, he's completely hidden himself.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.050
...Did you?

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.050
Yes.

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:32.780
Pretty savvy of you.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:39.750
Your brother saw something
different, beyond what we see.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.260
I've no idea what it is,

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:49.500
but he might actually be where
he's always wished to be.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:56.510
They used to belong to an organization
conducting Persona development.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:00.780
Then later withdrew from the team and
continued to research on their own.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.750
What... is this? Why?

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:10.220
They're your parents before
becoming picture book writers.

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:15.490
Kanzato never told me about this.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:24.000
I see... his parents' atonement is the
source for his sense of duty... However...

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:30.030
That's not the only thing... He knew
something more urgent, more dangerous...

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:45.250
I'm afraid Kanzato may have faced
off against Kujo half a year ago.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:51.820
He feared not the Persona
research, but the man in power.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:54.270
Then, aniki is...

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.030
With the Whale.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:01.600
If we accept the existence of the girl, Ayane...

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:05.970
Then he must be at the place that word represents.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.560
Jun...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.920
Are you by yourself?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:19.890
Yeah.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.290
I saw it... Ryo-niichan.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:29.200
I see.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:41.540
Kanaru-san?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:43.410
Jun-kun...

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.880
Did you wanna see Shin-oniichan again?

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:55.180
I... um, I think you and oniichan are a good match.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:58.520
You like him, right?

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.930
Oh... Umm... well...

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:09.630
I couldn't figure you out at
first, but now I understand.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:16.250
I mean, not now... like, not
right at this moment, but...

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:20.080
Jun-kun... You're acting differently...

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:24.320
So, what part of Shin-oniichan do you like?

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:31.470
I think it was broken to start with.
Please, don't worry about it.

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:35.240
Is that so? Well, I've already done this much.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.830
It's almost done...

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.260
That book...

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:45.300
A Whale's Feather... We had it, too. It was
my daughter's favorite, for some reason.

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:49.210
No offense, but I don't find it that interesting.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.980
I heard critics weren't that pleased.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:57.020
But I read it again for the first time
in a while, and I kind of get it now.

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:01.590
It's a soothing book for someone lonely.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.820
There, it's done.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.070
Shin... What's this of?

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.980
I'm not sure... I've never seen it before.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:24.350
Megumi-san already knows.
Takuro-san and Inui-san too, a little.

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:26.450
Oniichan is the only one who hasn't noticed.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.820
What about Mayuri-chan?

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:31.380
She's... got a high wall up, or...

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.760
Mayuri-chan...

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.730
Jun-kun, we'll take you home.

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.970
I can't use it right now, you know.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.370
You, too.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.980
One more task before the end.

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:57.050
We played school for way too long.

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:05.180
Kanaru-san!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.390
Morimoto-san!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.300
Are you all right? Get a hold of yourself.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:23.840
I have to follow that car...

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.240
I'll get someone for you, so stay here.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:58.210
Itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:04.250
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:10.620
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:15.700
kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:25.910
ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:31.110
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:31.310
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:37.450
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:37.520
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
After wiping away the tears

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:43.320
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:43.420
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
Even if I lose everything

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:47.260
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:53.530
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:59.310
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:59.310 --> 00:22:59.370
kesenai kizumo itsuka
will someday become my pride

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:06.910
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.690
Whether it came from far away,

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:18.160
or was there from the beginning,

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:21.290
I have no idea now.

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:26.920
An empty container, only
allowed to become a puppet.

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:30.140
It's okay to be alive.

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:34.710
That alone would've helped to accept everything.

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:37.580
It'll never come near.

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:39.550
A herd of innocent critters.
